      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string",
        "@value": "A unit to measure the spiciness or \"heat\" of chili peppers and substances based on their concentration of capsaicinoids. \n                    The scale indicates how many times a chili extract must be diluted in sugar water before its heat is undetectable to tasters."
